                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game has really great level design, and is generally well thought out. The mechanics are quite simple to grasp, but the masses of cubes provide quite a challenge in places, especially when you are also trying to avoid being teleported by the flashy cubes.\n\nIf you like being a little guy in a buggy shooting things in a space ship, then I would highly recommend this game. Also has some platforming / puzzle elements.\n\nI have been following this project since Alpha and it's great to finally see it on Steam! A well polished and finished product.",
